matched","hash_xxh64":"0x526DBCECA93C7CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121268012:0":{"text":"でも、アタシはまだ行けない……聖石町へ、あの将軍のところに戻らなきゃ。","source_cn":"可是我不能走……我得回到圣石镇，回到那位将军面前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EE3EA914FAED6E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121268013:0":{"text":"アルファⅪ……ママが悪いの？ママは悪くないわよね？悪くないって言って！","source_cn":"阿尔法十一……是妈妈做错了吗？你告诉妈妈，妈妈没有错，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCADBB335FD3B7680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121268014:0":{"text":"ママ……どうしたの？","source_cn":"妈妈……你怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA8469FB855A75A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121268015:0":{"text":"そうよ……悪いのは私じゃないわ！\n――私じゃない！私はすべてを差し出したのに！","source_cn":"对……错的不是我！\\n——不是我！我明明愿意付出一切！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04D0C559C5A1A73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121268016:0":{"text":"イルシカ様、飲み過ぎですよ！もうその辺にしたほうが……","source_cn":"伊露西卡女士，您喝醉了！快把酒杯放下吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB52FED012391E3FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","varia